- Atomic fetch
  When fetching cert, chain, key it may happen that on the server side
  one of these items changed in between, thus having a mismatch between
  cert and key.

  Possible Solutions:

  - The server may send a cookie (using the infix of the specified
    file), the client then may use this cookie to ask for the
    timestamped variant of the related file(s)

  - Send all items in a multipart Response

	GET /v1/all/example.com?format=PEM	 # get cert, chain, key as multipart
	GET /v1/bundle/example.com?format=PKCS12 # get the all-in-one file
